AKS issue where pods cannot communicate with external services

Step 1: Confirm the Issue Scope
Step 2: Check DNS Resolution Inside Pods
Step 3: Check AKS Network Configuration


network-issue-resolved.md
CMD : kubectl exec -it <pod-name> -- curl https://google.com
Checked DNS Resolution
CMD : kubectl exec -it <pod-name> -- nslookup google.com
Inspected CoreDNS Status
CMD : kubectl get pods -n <pod-name>-l <app-name>=kube-dns
      kubectl logs -n <pod-name> -l <app-name>=kube-dns
Checked Network Policies
CMD : kubectl get networkpolicy --all-namespaces
Reviewed Node Logs
CMD : kubectl logs -n <pod-name> -l <app-name>=kube-proxy
